/// PanLL VAB Catalog — The complete proven-servers component library.
///
/// Hardcoded catalog of all 108 verified server components from the
/// proven-servers project. Each entry declares ports, dependencies,
/// capabilities, and description for the VAB assembly panel.
///
/// Component breakdown:
///   - 8 core primitives (socket, frame, fsm, wire, compose, tls, config, audit)
///   - 94 protocol implementations across 9 domains
///   - 6 connector interfaces (dbconn, cacheconn, storageconn, queueconn, authconn, resolverconn)
///
/// All components are formally verified Idris2 with %default total and
/// zero believe_me instances.

/// Uses VabModel types directly (not Model) to avoid dependency cycles.
/// Model includes VabModel, but also references VabCatalog — so we go
/// straight to the leaf module.
open VabModel

// ===========================================================================
// Core Primitives (8)
// ===========================================================================

